From: Project Luma
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: own network editor frame, actions and navigation in LumaUI

Keep the native NetworkManager edit/validate/save/cancel paths and every
connection setting. Replace the legacy window/header actions and notebook
chrome with shared LumaUI frame, island, buttons and page choices.

